8,"Across China: In China's Hainan, 86-yr-old artist gives modern makeover ...",http://belt.china.org.cn/2022-02/22/content_78064169.htm,"TO GO WITH ""Across China: In China's Hainan, 86-yr-old artist gives modern makeover to traditional music"" (Xinhua) HAIKOU, Feb. 17 (Xinhua) -- For the Spring Festival holiday, Huang Zihe and his troupe visited various venues and performed with the Hainan Bayin, a traditional musical instrument endemic to south China's Hainan Province.",Hainanese,Sino-Tibetan
9,Harmonize Hainan Live: Li-Style Lantern Festival,https://www.hicn.cn/system/2023/02/05/032918644.shtml,"This installment of the Harmonize Hainan live stream series brings together inheritors of Li ethnic folk music, famous Hainanese musicians and a new generation of folk singers against the backdrop of Hainan's highest peak for performances, a chat, and a taste of the local delicacies.",Hainanese,Sino-Tibetan
